From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blizz <blizz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 18:50:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Forward-declare SkillLineEntry in Player.h
 (clang/libc++/musl)

IsClassicProfessionChildSkill(SkillLineEntry const*) uses SkillLineEntry,
which Player.h never forward-declares. It compiles where another header
pulls in DB2Structure.h before Player.h (the maintainer's glibc/gcc build),
but not with clang/libc++/musl, which parse Player.h without it. Adds the
missing forward declaration, like the other DB2 structs above it.
---
 src/server/game/Entities/Player/Player.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/server/game/Entities/Player/Player.h b/src/server/game/Entities/Player/Player.h
index d87f3ab8..451ea32b 100644
--- a/src/server/game/Entities/Player/Player.h
+++ b/src/server/game/Entities/Player/Player.h
@@ -63,6 +63,7 @@ struct MapEntry;
 struct PvpTalentEntry;
 struct QuestPackageItemEntry;
 struct RewardPackEntry;
+struct SkillLineEntry;
 struct SkillRaceClassInfoEntry;
 struct SpellCastRequest;
 struct TalentEntry;
